==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 3~20 seconds<sup>90f~600f</sup>.
*6 [[Hippoe]]s spawn, delay 6~20 seconds<sup>180f~600f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[One Horn]] spawns as the boss.
**Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn, delay 1~6 seconds<sup>30f~180f</sup>.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.
**1 [[Jackie Peng]] spawns.

==Strategy==
Use [[Ninja Cat (Special Cat)|Frog Ninja Cats]], [[Bird Cat (Normal Cat)|UFO Cats]], and maybe a [[Fish Cat (Normal Cat)|Whale Cat]] to easily defeat the enemies.

